(text "TX pair terminates at remote receiver. Local 120R fitted. Pin 6 SHIELD -> isolated CHASSIS lug SH1.\nConnector -> TVS -> 10R -> transceiver. Reference: TI THVD14xx Figure 38 / Table 7.\nCommon ground; cross TX to remote RX. No galvanic isolation. Protection rating requires board-level testing." (at 20 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a5d21179-7431-553d-ab3e-62596391c9d2)))
